    tags: [
      "dairy free protein powder",
      "non dairy protein powder",
      "milk free protein powder",
      "dairy free protein powder for milk allergy",
      "vegan protein powder"
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Buyer's Guide"} badge={"Updated November 2026"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Best Dairy-Free Protein Powder</Fragment>
      No milk, no whey, no casein: the dairy-free powders worth buying on Amazon, and how to tell a dairy-free label from a lactose-free one.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
      <a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a>
      <a href="#top-picks">Our Top Picks</a>
      <a href="#lactose-free-vs-dairy-free">Lactose-Free vs Dairy-Free</a>
      <a href="#read-the-label">How to Read the Label</a>
