          <p>
            Protein figures come from each label or brand page at the time of writing and change between flavors and label versions, so check the tub you actually receive. We list protein source rather than price tier because, for a dairy-free buyer, the source decides both the taste and whether the powder suits a milk allergy, an egg allergy or a vegan diet. If you want to compare cost, work it out per 25 g of protein with our <a href="/tools/protein-cost-calculator/">protein cost calculator</a> rather than by the sticker price.
